This permission does not include a right to:

a) redistribute the Project outside the permitted platform functionality;

b) republish or mirror the Project;

c) upload the Project to another website, repository, hosting service, launcher, or platform;

d) modify and redistribute the Project;

e) create or distribute a derivative work based on the Project;

f) extract and separately redistribute Project Materials;

g) sell, sublicense, or commercially exploit the Project or Project Materials;

h) represent the Project or any part of it as their own work; or

i) grant any of the above rights to another person or entity,

unless such activity is expressly permitted by the Team Leader in writing or is otherwise required or permitted by applicable platform terms or mandatory law.

## 3.3 Separate Permission for Additional Uses

Permission to perform one act does not automatically grant permission to perform any other act.

Unless otherwise expressly stated in writing by the Team Leader, each permission is limited to the specific use for which it was granted.

