# 4. WRITTEN PERMISSION

## 4.1 Required Permission

Any use of Project Materials beyond the permissions expressly granted by this Agreement requires prior written permission from the Team Leader.

Such permission may be granted through a written license, agreement, repository notice, official Project statement, or other written authorization issued by the Team Leader.

## 4.2 No Implied Permission

