## 4.3 Retroactive Permission

Permission should be obtained before the relevant activity takes place.

Unless the Team Leader expressly confirms otherwise in writing, permission obtained after an unauthorized use will not be treated as retroactive authorization.

## 4.4 Authority

Only the Team Leader, or a person expressly authorized in writing by the Team Leader, may grant permissions under this Agreement on behalf of the Project.

